message: "If you use or adapt this course, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Phaser Course: a hands-on course in 2D browser games"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
authors:
  - family-names: Flores
    given-names: JP
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jpflores-13/phaser-course"
url: "https://jpflores-13.github.io/phaser-course"
abstract: >-
  A three-half-day, hands-on course on building 2D browser games with Phaser 4,
  for researchers who already code in R or Python. Learners build one small
  game (Cold Chain) from a blank canvas to a deployed site, then read a real
  game from Minus 80 Studios. Lessons render as web pages and slides from one
  Quarto source, with playable exercises and public answer keys.
keywords:
  - Phaser
  - game development
  - JavaScript
  - training
  - Quarto
